Pflugerville ISD serves families across Pflugerville, Texas, with safe, supportive campuses and innovative learning opportunities for pre-K through 12th grade. Our commitment to excellence prepares every student for college, careers, and life, building the next generation of Pfuture-ready leaders in Central Texas.

* * *

Questions or information requests regarding the district or this website can be directed to [communications@pfisd.net](mailto:communications@pfisd.net). Pflugerville ISD's designated agent for the Digital Millennium Copyright Act is Chief Operations Officer, Victor Valdez, Pflugerville ISD Technology Department, [digitalcopyright@pfisd.net](mailto:digitalcopyright@pfisd.net). To provide notice of alleged copyright infringement, please notify Mr. Valdez at the address/email specified above. Please know that PfISD has policies and procedures related to copyright laws, available here:[https://pol.tasb.org/Policy/Code/1147?filter=CY](https://pol.tasb.org/PolicyOnline/PolicyDetails?key=1147&code=CY#legalTabContent).

